Objective: Restore all damaged tanks back to perfect health.

Note the three tanks at the southern end of your complex. All three have taken damage, indicated by lower hit points. To see the hit points of all your units press the "Hits" button on the left side panel. Yellow hit bar indicates 50% or more damage. red when 75% percent or more damage.

Repair units can perform repairs on the field. Move one of the two repair units you have next to the tanks and select the "Repair" command by double clicking. Now click on adjacent units in need of repair. Repairs cost materials which vary depending on the severity of the damage.

Alternately, tanks can be brought into depots for repairs.

